commit dd1fae93b6ebd8e764ae1921cf771b5fb2cfce0e

C03: boolean cues with clitics and voseo; wifi read must not claim the whole network (NETWORK1293 residual)

planner: _TRUE_CUES/_FALSE_CUES accept «apagame», «encendé», «prendeme», «desactivame», «activalo»… so the literal normalizer grounds state without asking. llm: invented_connectivity also vetoes «ninguna red»/«sin red» from a wifi-only read.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


